{"code": 1, "data": {"content": "<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">晚8点，不熬夜</span><br />2021年京东11.11<br />以全新的方式开启了新一轮消费热潮<br />累计下单金额超<span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\"><span style=\"color: #c24f4a;\">3491亿元</span></span><br /><br /><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">不负每一份热爱与期待</span><br />全国超<span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\"><span style=\"color: #c24f4a;\">300城</span></span>实现分钟达<br /><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\"><span style=\"color: #c24f4a;\">93%</span></span>区县和<span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\"><span style=\"color: #c24f4a;\">84%</span></span>乡镇实现当日达和次日达<br />全链路预测准确率均值达到约<span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\"><span style=\"color: #c24f4a;\">95%</span></span><br />近<span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\"><span style=\"color: #c24f4a;\">400辆</span></span>智能快递车助力末端配送、抗疫保供<br />绿色供应链物流减碳<span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\"><span style=\"color: #c24f4a;\">26000吨</span></span><br />单日收入超千元的京东快递小哥数量增长超<span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\"><span style=\"color: #c24f4a;\">50%</span></span><br /><br />京东物流深耕一体化供应链物流服务<br />以技术为底层驱动力，降本、增效、提质<br />在数以亿级的包裹里，蕴藏了强大的流量密码<br />不断为客户、行业、社会创造价值<br />同时，也收获了最为珍贵的认可与信赖</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: large;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: large;\"><img style=\"max-width: 100%;\" src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/218641/15/6180/249290/61a62650Ec00e51a7/fb0666b22c37e6ba.jpg\" /><img style=\"max-width: 100%;\" src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/139668/7/25113/583482/61a62657E3e7c7ff6/a96ccb56a9baf0ea.jpg\" /><img style=\"max-width: 100%;\" src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/164580/38/21753/637693/61a6266dE24d2c813/ef654e5cff84f4e5.jpg\" /><img style=\"box-shadow: #333333 0px 0px 5px; max-width: 100%;\" src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jf